Subject: [PATCH] dash: expose adaptation-set labels as stream titles

Retain the first non-empty supplied Label and expose it through the
standard stream-scoped GST_TAG_TITLE. This distinguishes same-language
audio tracks without fetching or guessing metadata in the application.
Absent/empty labels do not add a tag or change language selection.
Cover supplied labels, missing values, whitespace, UTF-8, escaped XML,
multiple labels, and node serialization in the existing MPD tests.

Upstream-Status: Pending
AI-Generated: OpenAI Codex
